- en.i18n.yaml: `first`: the links form a cycle: `first` → `second` → `third` → `first`
- en.i18n.yaml: `second`: the links form a cycle: `second` → `third` → `first` → `second`
- en.i18n.yaml: `third`: the links form a cycle: `third` → `first` → `second` → `third`
- en.i18n.yaml: `loop`: the links form a cycle: `loop` → `loop`
